    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Where the figures come from",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI Semibold",
                      "fontSize": "13pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• The general ledger from 2022: Oasis up to each hospital's move to Fusion, Fusion from that month on. The Cutover difference column and the balance sheet's Difference show any gap the move left.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• The income statement uses the lines of Fusion's profitability report; Oasis accounts are mapped onto the same lines, so years compare.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Budgets: the yearly budget file, plus any line the BI manager enters. Against budget, All hospitals compares only the hospitals and months that have a budget (like for like).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• KPI targets are set per year by the BI manager, for each hospital or for all.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Head Office is not included. The data is refreshed every night.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Questions, a budget or a target to change: contact the BI manager.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "10.5pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
